{"sha": "e7eb66307dfb0f2dd2fcf7846445c5c3274767c171475f7534f2d0774340c54f", "body": ["\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:5}", "设 $F(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\eu^{-xt}}{1 +", "t^2}\\,\\dd t$，其中 $x \\geq 0$。证明 $F$ 在", "$\\intco{0}{\\infty}$ 上连续，$C^2$ 性质在 $\\intoo{0}{\\infty}$ 上成立，并在其上满足 $F'' +", "F = \\frac1x$，且 $F(x) \\to 0$（$x \\to +\\infty$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:6}", "（弗鲁拉尼积分）设 $f$ 在 $\\intco{0}{+\\infty}$ 上连续，", "并有有限极限 $f(\\infty)$（在 $+\\infty$ 处）。证明：对 $a, b > 0$，", "\\[", "\\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{f(at) - f(bt)}{t}\\,\\dd t", "= \\bigl(f(0) - f(\\infty)\\bigr)\\,\\ln\\frac ba .", "\\]", "\\emph{（在 $\\intcc{\\varepsilon}{M}$ 上对每一部分作代换，", "并将结果重新组合为 $\\int_{a\\varepsilon}^{b\\varepsilon} -", "\\int_{aM}^{bM}$ 关于 $\\frac{f(u)}u\\,\\dd u$ 的积分，", "再利用 $0$ 处的连续性与 $\\infty$ 处的极限夹逼。）}计算", "$\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t} - \\eu^{-2t}}{t}\\dd t$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:7}", "证明并计算 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\displaystyle\\int_0^n", "\\Bigl(1 - \\frac tn\\Bigr)^{\\!n} t^{x-1}\\,\\dd t$，其中 $x > 0$", "\\emph{（用控制收敛定理，取 $\\varphi(t) = \\eu^{-t}t^{x-1}$，", "利用 $(1 - t/n)^n \\leq \\eu^{-t}$；极限为 $\\Gamma(x)$）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:8}", "（用参数技巧计算高斯积分）设 $x \\geq 0$，令", "\\[", "G(x) = \\Bigl(\\int_0^x \\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t\\Bigr)^{\\!2},", "\\qquad", "H(x) = \\int_0^1 \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2(1+t^2)}}{1 + t^2}\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "证明 $G' + H' = 0$（在积分号下对 $H$ 求导，并", "在所得积分中作代换 $u = xt$），由此推出 $G(x) + H(x)", "= \\frac\\pi4$ 对所有 $x$ 成立，并得出", "\\[", "\\int_0^{\\infty} \\eu^{-t^2}\\,\\dd t = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}{2} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:9}", "证明 $\\Gamma$ 为\\emph{对数凸}函数，即 $\\ln\\Gamma$ 在", "$\\intoo{0}{\\infty}$ 上为凸函数。\\emph{（对积分形式的柯西--施瓦茨不等式", "应用于 $t^{(x+y)/2 - 1}\\eu^{-t} = \\bigl(t^{x-1}\\eu^{-t}\\bigr)^{1/2}", "\\bigl(t^{y-1}\\eu^{-t}\\bigr)^{1/2}$ 可得", "$\\Gamma\\bigl(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\bigr)^2 \\leq \\Gamma(x)\\Gamma(y)$；", "再结合连续性，并利用\\cref{exo:b2:realfun:8}。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:10}", "（狄利克雷积分）设 $F(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty}", "\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\,\\eu^{-xt}\\,\\dd t$，其中 $x > 0$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 证明 $F'(x) = -\\frac{1}{1 + x^2}$（在", "        积分号下求导；计算 $\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\sin t\\,\\dd", "        t$，通过两次分部积分。）", "  \\item 证明 $F(x) \\to 0$（$x \\to +\\infty$），并由此推出 $F(x) =", "        \\frac\\pi2 - \\arctan x$。", "  \\item 承认 $F$ 在 $0^+$ 处的连续性（阿贝尔型", "        定理），求半收敛", "        积分的值：", "        \\[", "        \\int_0^{\\infty} \\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\,\\dd t = \\frac{\\pi}{2}.", "        \\]", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:11}", "证明 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty", "\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\Bigr)^{\\!2}\\dd t$ 收敛，然后用一次", "分部积分及\\cref{exo:b2:integration:10}计算其值：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty \\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\Bigr)^{\\!2}\\dd t", "= \\frac{\\pi}{2} .", "\\]", "（其值与 $\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\dd t$ 相同 --- 但", "这一次是绝对收敛。）", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:integration:12}", "（高斯积分的尾部）设 $x > 0$，令 $T(x) = \\displaystyle", "\\int_x^\\infty \\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 注意到 $\\eu^{-t^2} = \\frac{1}{-2t}\\cdot(-2t\\,\\eu^{-t^2})$，", "        连续两次分部积分，得：", "        \\[", "        T(x) = \\eu^{-x^2}\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{2x} -", "        \\frac{1}{4x^3}\\Bigr) +", "        \\frac34\\int_x^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t^2}}{t^4}\\,\\dd t .", "        \\]", "  \\item 估计余项：$0 \\leq \\frac34\\int_x^\\infty", "        t^{-4}\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t \\leq \\frac{3}{8x^5}\\,\\eu^{-x^2}$，", "        并由此得如下夹逼：", "        \\[", "        \\eu^{-x^2}\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{2x} - \\frac{1}{4x^3}\\Bigr)", "        \\leq T(x) \\leq \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x},", "        \\qquad\\text{因此}\\qquad", "        T(x) \\sim \\frac{\\eu^{-x^2}}{2x} \\quad (x \\to +\\infty).", "        \\]", "  \\item 为何由反复分部积分得到的完整交错级数", "        对固定的 $x$ 永不收敛？\\emph{（比较", "        系数 $1\\cdot3\\cdots(2k-1)$ 的增长与", "        幂 $(2x^2)^k$ 的增长。）}", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\section{问题：欧拉积分 --- Beta 函数、Gamma 函数与", "高斯极限公式}", ""]}